WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.350
[Warm ambient lounge music]

2
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.234
Lighting coals, stretching foil, ash on the table, and refreshing charcoal every 20 minutes...

3
00:00:04.274 --> 00:00:08.872
That era is officially over.

4
00:00:09.222 --> 00:00:14.621
Meet the patent-protected NARION Smart HMD.

5
00:00:14.661 --> 00:00:21.872
A 100% real shisha leaf, fully cordless and charcoal-free smart hookah head.

6
00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:26.965
Because no charcoal burns, carbon monoxide stays at 0.0 ppm.

7
00:00:27.005 --> 00:00:33.688
Pure shisha aroma from the first draw to the last—without coal headaches or smoke odor.

8
00:00:34.038 --> 00:00:42.035
Inside the 8-layer patented architecture, an Al2O3 honeycomb ceramic heater locks heat within ±1°C.

9
00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:46.471
A Nano-Aerogel thermal shield keeps the outer shell cool below 42°C.

10
00:00:46.821 --> 00:00:51.611
Select Soft, Medium, or Hard directly on the embedded OLED display.

11
00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:59.321
A smart draw sensor boosts power on every inhale and cuts power in 200 ms if tilted.

12
00:00:59.671 --> 00:01:08.531
Lift off the 65W Pogo-Pin dock; preheat in 3.5 min on any hookah or NARION 45° Bayonet stem.

13
00:01:08.571 --> 00:01:14.202
Enjoy 90–110 min cordless sessions with the 74 Wh battery and 5-second cartridge hot-swap.

14
00:01:14.552 --> 00:01:21.537
NARION Smart HMD. Beyond charcoal—pure hookah engineering.

15
00:01:21.577 --> 00:01:24.161
Series 01 pre-orders open — narionhookah.com
